{"o'clock":[{"c":"Be at the station at 11 o'clock sharp.","cn":"十一点准时到车站。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #708069 (Eldad) & #4972587 (wzhd)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/708069"},{"c":"Come and see me at eleven o'clock.","cn":"十一點鐘來看我。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #73355 (CK) & #871219 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/73355"}],"oak":[{"c":"It's an oak tree.","cn":"這是一棵橡樹。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #5951637 (mailohilohi) & #13573832 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5951637"},{"c":"When it's windy, the leaves of the old oak rustle and its branches creak.","cn":"刮風的時候，老橡樹的葉子會沙沙作響，樹枝會發出嘎吱聲。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #8928885 (sundown) & #13573840 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/8928885"}],"oath":[{"c":"The knight swore an oath of allegiance to the king.","cn":"騎士宣誓效忠於國王。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #25630 (Scott) & #7753622 (Leolaaziano)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/25630"}],"obese":[{"c":"Tom is obese, isn't he?","cn":"汤姆很胖，是吧？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3417057 (CK) & #5091616 (mirrorvan)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3417057"}],"obey":[{"c":"I can't do anything but obey him.","cn":"我除了聽從他之外什麼也不能做。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #403376 (CK) & #875384 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/403376"},{"c":"It's our duty to obey the law.","cn":"遵守法律是我們的義務。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #9812294 (CK) & #775461 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/9812294"}],"object":[{"c":"I object to her going there alone.","cn":"我不同意她一个人去那儿。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #261007 (CK) & #333922 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/261007"},{"c":"UFO stands for unidentified flying object.","cn":"UFO代表不明飛行物體。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #72170 (CK) & #797097 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/72170"}],"objection":[{"c":"As for me, I have no objection.","cn":"对于我，我不反对。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #255143 (CM) & #5842620 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/255143"},{"c":"I have no objection to your plan.","cn":"我不反對你的計劃。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #252826 (CK) & #875333 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/252826"}],"obligation":[{"c":"It is our obligation to help.","cn":"幫助是我們的義務。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #267184 (bluepie88) & #907299 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/267184"}],"obscure":[{"c":"The meaning of this sentence is obscure.","cn":"这句句子意思模糊。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #44123 (CM) & #802879 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/44123"}],"observatory":[{"c":"He built an observatory to study the stars.","cn":"為了觀測星象，他建了一座瞭望台。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #803220 (Source_VOA) & #1238439 (tsayng)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/803220"}],"observe":[{"c":"We must observe the rules.","cn":"我们必须遵守规则。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #20225 (CK) & #334729 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/20225"}],"obstinate":[{"c":"He became more obstinate as he grew older.","cn":"他年紀越大變得越頑固。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #296818 (CK) & #834982 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/296818"},{"c":"Tom is being quite obstinate, isn't he?","cn":"汤姆挺固执的不是吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3417047 (CK) & #6799640 (basilhan)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3417047"}],"obvious":[{"c":"It seems obvious that he is sick.","cn":"似乎很明顯他病了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #414634 (CK) & #891030 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/414634"},{"c":"It's obvious why his stomach hurts.","cn":"他為什麼會胃痛的原因很明顯。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #283251 (CK) & #863971 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/283251"}],"obviously":[{"c":"He can speak French, and obviously English.","cn":"他能說法語，當然還有英語。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #292640 (CK) & #5581658 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/292640"},{"c":"Someone is obviously telling a lie.","cn":"顯然有人在撒謊。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #322994 (CK) & #855685 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/322994"}],"occasion":[{"c":"What's the happy occasion?","cn":"什么事这么开心？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #11294139 (Aphima) & #10028154 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/11294139"}],"occasional":[{"c":"Tomorrow's weather should be sunny with occasional rain.","cn":"明天天气晴转阵雨。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #323216 (CK) & #2567436 (fenfang557)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/323216"}],"occasionally":[{"c":"The mother occasionally reread her son's letter.","cn":"这位母亲偶尔会重温她的儿子的信件。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1532036 (LittleBoy) & #2567495 (fenfang557)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1532036"},{"c":"He occasionally reads detective novels.","cn":"他偶尔会阅读一些侦探小说。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #482308 (adjusting) & #2567442 (fenfang557)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/482308"}],"occupation":[{"c":"What is your occupation?","cn":"你做什么工作？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #731142 (CM) & #3378243 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/731142"}],"occupational":[{"c":"Demand for occupational therapy has surged in recent years.","cn":"这几年对作业疗法的需求在迅速增长。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #422353 (blay_paul) & #8739478 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/422353"}],"occur":[{"c":"Nobody knows when the earthquake will occur.","cn":"没有人知道地震何时会来。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #65985 (CK) & #404458 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/65985"},{"c":"Bright ideas never occur to me.","cn":"我總想不出什麼好點子。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #36516 (CM) & #1426352 (tsayng)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/36516"}],"ocean":[{"c":"We can hear the ocean from here.","cn":"我們從這裡可以聽到海的聲音。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #62094 (CK) & #900647 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/62094"},{"c":"He crossed the Pacific Ocean in thirty days.","cn":"他用30天横渡了太平洋。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #288522 (CM) & #406331 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/288522"}],"october":[{"c":"I was born on October 10th, 1972.","cn":"我在一九七二年十月十日出生。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #852909 (piksea) & #738370 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/852909"},{"c":"Leaves begin to fall in October.","cn":"樹葉在十月開始掉落下來。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #323614 (CK) & #801342 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/323614"}],"odd":[{"c":"I know people think I'm odd.","cn":"我知道人們認為我古怪。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #5249715 (CK) & #6111850 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5249715"},{"c":"One is the smallest odd number.","cn":"一是最小的奇數。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #13238598 (atitarev) & #13238054 (mimosawang)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/13238598"}],"of":[{"c":"A dolphin is a kind of mammal.","cn":"海豚是一種哺乳動物。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #65811 (CK) & #873292 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/65811"},{"c":"A football team consists of eleven players.","cn":"一个足球队由十一个球员组成。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #34340 (CM) & #1881095 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/34340"}],"of course":[{"c":"Of course she can speak English.","cn":"她當然會講英語。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #388652 (CK) & #850319 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/388652"},{"c":"Of course she passed the test.","cn":"當然，她通過了測驗。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #388565 (CK) & #851467 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/388565"}],"off":[{"c":"Don't forget to turn the light off.","cn":"不要忘了關燈。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #279155 (CK) & #883446 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/279155"},{"c":"He forgot to turn off the light.","cn":"他忘了關燈。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #301809 (CK) & #884175 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/301809"}],"offend":[{"c":"I didn't mean to offend anyone.","cn":"我不想冒犯任何人。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #5643113 (CK) & #13138111 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5643113"},{"c":"I didn't mean to offend you.","cn":"我沒想要冒犯您。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2282414 (Hybrid) & #13138212 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2282414"}],"offensive":[{"c":"The speaker's comments were highly offensive.","cn":"发言人的评论极有攻击性。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #681610 (Source_VOA) & #5611472 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/681610"}],"offer":[{"c":"I am willing to take your offer.","cn":"我願意接受你的報價。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #70535 (CK) & #926805 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/70535"},{"c":"I expected him to offer some help.","cn":"我期待他提供一些幫助。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #263331 (CK) & #888049 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/263331"}],"office":[{"c":"He goes to the office by car.","cn":"他開車去辦公室。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #294629 (CK) & #804821 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/294629"},{"c":"He works with me at the office.","cn":"他跟我在這間辦公室一起工作。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #294636 (CK) & #880281 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/294636"}],"officer":[{"c":"The police officer arrested the burglar.","cn":"警官逮捕了竊賊。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #400568 (CK) & #870316 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/400568"}],"official":[{"c":"Now it is official.","cn":"現在它是官方的了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1244011 (CM) & #5900363 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1244011"},{"c":"This news is official.","cn":"这是官方消息。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #57159 (CK) & #334538 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/57159"}],"often":[{"c":"Do you often have fish for dinner?","cn":"你常常晚餐吃魚嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #39685 (CK) & #881234 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/39685"},{"c":"He often laughs at his own jokes.","cn":"他常常因他自己的笑話而笑。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #293287 (CK) & #876703 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/293287"}],"oil":[{"c":"I bought a bottle of salad oil.","cn":"我買了一瓶沙拉油。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #253864 (CK) & #880279 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/253864"},{"c":"Japan depends on foreign countries for oil.","cn":"日本依賴外國的石油。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #281564 (CK) & #798170 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/281564"}],"ok":[{"c":"Is it OK to take pictures here?","cn":"这里允许拍照吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #8032107 (CK) & #332926 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/8032107"},{"c":"The less you know, the better, OK?","cn":"你知道的越少越好，好吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2641951 (CK) & #9974949 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2641951"}],"old":[{"c":"An old man broke into our conversation.","cn":"一位老人打斷了我們的談話。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #27619 (Zifre) & #918088 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/27619"},{"c":"Can you guess how old I am?","cn":"你能猜到我的年龄吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4755353 (garborg) & #333677 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4755353"}],"olympic":[{"c":"He took part in the Olympic Games.","cn":"他参加了奥运会。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #289443 (CK) & #335411 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/289443"},{"c":"Tom was an Olympic swimmer.","cn":"汤姆是奥运会游泳运动员。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3921516 (CK) & #10019745 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3921516"}],"olympics":[{"c":"What are the origins of the Olympics?","cn":"奥林匹克的起源是什么？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #64813 (CK) & #334994 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/64813"},{"c":"I missed the opening ceremony of the Olympics.","cn":"我错过了奥运会的开幕式。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #7790183 (sharris123) & #1738287 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/7790183"}],"omit":[{"c":"What did I omit?","cn":"我省略了什麼？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #12087262 (CK) & #13138864 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/12087262"}],"on":[{"c":"A fly can walk on the ceiling.","cn":"蒼蠅能在天花板上走。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #35496 (CK) & #798176 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/35496"},{"c":"A white dove is on the roof.","cn":"屋顶上有只白鸽。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1521752 (steve) & #389833 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1521752"}],"once":[{"c":"Africa was once called the Dark Continent.","cn":"非洲曾經被稱為黑暗大陸。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #67751 (CK) & #801435 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/67751"},{"c":"Could you please repeat it once again?","cn":"請您再說一遍好嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #433597 (CK) & #868438 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/433597"}],"one":[{"c":"Any one of us could do it.","cn":"我們之中任何一個都能做到。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #247367 (CK) & #798190 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/247367"},{"c":"Are you the one who did that?","cn":"你就是做那事的人嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #6089891 (CK) & #6120909 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6089891"}],"ones":[{"c":"We'll probably be the first ones there.","cn":"我們可能是最先到那裡的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2953867 (CK) & #6216623 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2953867"},{"c":"American kitchens are much bigger than Japanese ones.","cn":"美式厨房比日式的大。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #67564 (CK) & #843412 (kooler)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/67564"}],"ongoing":[{"c":"It's an ongoing investigation.","cn":"調查進行中。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3725665 (CM) & #13118950 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3725665"},{"c":"The project is ongoing.","cn":"该项目正在进行中。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #7964846 (Hybrid) & #8563442 (slo_oth)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/7964846"}],"online":[{"c":"I bought a book online.","cn":"我在網上買了一本書。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #8770101 (shekitten) & #8767481 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/8770101"},{"c":"I sell clothing online.","cn":"我在網路上賣衣服。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #844710 (CM) & #844709 (egg0073)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/844710"}],"only":[{"c":"He's the only survivor in the village.","cn":"他是村子里面唯一在世的人。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1577322 (CM) & #1577306 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1577322"},{"c":"Her only pleasure is listening to music.","cn":"她唯一的樂趣就是聽音樂。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #309832 (CK) & #754658 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/309832"}],"onto":[{"c":"She elbowed her way onto the train.","cn":"她擠上了火車。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #317496 (CK) & #894075 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/317496"},{"c":"He jumped onto the table.","cn":"他跳上了桌子。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #713165 (CM) & #713161 (Yashanti)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/713165"}],"open":[{"c":"All of my software is open source.","cn":"我的软件全都是开源的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #6011113 (mailohilohi) & #8686686 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6011113"},{"c":"Excuse me, may I open the window?","cn":"不好意思，请问我可以开窗吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1510742 (Eldad) & #1867043 (yuzazaza)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1510742"}],"opened":[{"c":"His wife opened the door for him.","cn":"他的妻子為他開門了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #286372 (CK) & #889565 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/286372"},{"c":"I opened the box and looked inside.","cn":"我打開盒子看看裡面。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #259923 (CK) & #875381 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/259923"}],"opening":[{"c":"I broke the lock opening the door.","cn":"我开门的时候弄坏了锁。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #387983 (Mouseneb) & #332912 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/387983"},{"c":"Would you mind my opening the door?","cn":"你介意我開門嗎?","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #39004 (CK) & #903474 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/39004"}],"opera":[{"c":"Tom is an opera fan.","cn":"湯姆是歌劇愛好者。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #9376058 (CK) & #13573914 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/9376058"}],"operate":[{"c":"The doctor decided to operate at once.","cn":"医生决定立刻动手术。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #28013 (CK) & #6822734 (basilhan)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/28013"}],"operating":[{"c":"What's your favorite operating system?","cn":"你最喜欢的操作系统是哪个？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #906963 (CK) & #7774751 (jiangche)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/906963"}],"operation":[{"c":"Doctors refused to perform a second operation.","cn":"医生们拒绝做第二次手术。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #28090 (CK) & #1467060 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/28090"},{"c":"I don't want to have an operation.","cn":"我不想接受手術。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #266018 (CK) & #881557 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/266018"}],"operator":[{"c":"The telephone operator asked the caller to hold on until a connection was made.","cn":"电话运营商提示来电人等候接通。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #240277 (CM) & #7834250 (olia1204)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/240277"}],"opinion":[{"c":"I agree with your opinion about taxes.","cn":"我同意你對於稅的意見。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #259004 (CK) & #887890 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/259004"},{"c":"I had a good opinion of her.","cn":"我對她的評價很好。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #261334 (CH) & #801908 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/261334"}],"opportunity":[{"c":"He made good use of the opportunity.","cn":"他好好地利用了這個機會。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #290660 (CK) & #819236 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/290660"},{"c":"He made the best of the opportunity.","cn":"他善用了這個機會。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #290663 (CK) & #796027 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/290663"}],"opposed":[{"c":"I'm opposed to any type of war.","cn":"我反對任何形式的戰爭。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #255307 (CK) & #893501 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/255307"},{"c":"I'm strongly opposed to a compromise.","cn":"我强烈反对妥协","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4970631 (CK) & #12615419 (Enzo)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4970631"}],"opposite":[{"c":"The opposite sides of a parallelogram are parallel.","cn":"平行四边形的对边平行。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #499388 (blay_paul) & #9932480 (SbrAkr)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/499388"},{"c":"They went in opposite directions.","cn":"他們往相反的方向去。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #681651 (Source_VOA) & #781114 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/681651"}],"opposition":[{"c":"The Prime Minister's speech was calculated to anger the opposition parties.","cn":"總理的發言估計激怒了在野黨。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #266139 (CK) & #830358 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/266139"}],"optimist":[{"c":"I'm an optimist by nature.","cn":"我天生是一個樂觀主義者。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #6873155 (CK) & #918033 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6873155"}],"optimistic":[{"c":"I'm not as optimistic as you are.","cn":"我不像你那么乐观。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #8586015 (CK) & #8589652 (tianblr)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/8586015"},{"c":"I'm not as optimistic as you.","cn":"我不像你那么乐观。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #8586504 (CK) & #8589652 (tianblr)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/8586504"}],"option":[{"c":"What other option is there?","cn":"還有其他選擇嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4012787 (CK) & #13736380 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4012787"}],"or":[{"c":"Apples are usually green, yellow, or red.","cn":"蘋果通常是綠色、黃色或紅色。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2976130 (patgfisher) & #13539405 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2976130"},{"c":"Are you a teacher or a student?","cn":"您是老师，还是学生？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #370763 (saeb) & #4264871 (notabene)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/370763"}],"orange":[{"c":"There is an orange on the table.","cn":"桌上有一只橙子。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #39619 (CK) & #334500 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/39619"},{"c":"We don't have any more orange juice.","cn":"我們沒有柳橙汁了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #9462179 (CK) & #13539897 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/9462179"}],"orbit":[{"c":"Many moons orbit around Saturn.","cn":"許多衛星繞著土星運行。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #681652 (Source_VOA) & #918539 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/681652"},{"c":"It takes 165 years for Neptune to orbit around the sun.","cn":"海王星繞行太陽一周要花一百六十五年。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #681653 (Source_VOA) & #4272234 (egg0073)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/681653"}],"orchard":[{"c":"They stole apples from my orchard.","cn":"他們從我的果園偷了蘋果。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #306693 (CK) & #874291 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/306693"}],"orchestra":[{"c":"Do you know the concert schedule of London Symphony Orchestra?","cn":"你知道伦敦交响乐团的演奏会行程吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #29284 (CK) & #791577 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/29284"}],"order":[{"c":"Unfortunately, the telephone was out of order.","cn":"不幸的是電話壞了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #26622 (CK) & #801468 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/26622"},{"c":"Are you ready to order now?","cn":"您决定好要下订单了吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #54371 (CK) & #2393341 (fenfang557)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/54371"}],"ordinary":[{"c":"I did nothing out of the ordinary.","cn":"我沒做不尋常的事。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #65106 (CK) & #917788 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/65106"},{"c":"He is no ordinary student.","cn":"他不是个普通的学生。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #295845 (CM) & #8897464 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/295845"}],"organ":[{"c":"Are you able to play organ?","cn":"你会弹管风琴吗?","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4841310 (sicerabibax) & #390524 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4841310"},{"c":"Do you know how to play the organ?","cn":"你会弹管风琴吗?","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #6254081 (CK) & #390524 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6254081"}],"organic":[{"c":"Tom and Mary own a small organic farm.","cn":"汤姆和玛丽拥有一个小型的有机农场。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #5085372 (Hybrid) & #5085446 (Jubilee11)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5085372"}],"organization":[{"c":"The organization furnished the refugees with food.","cn":"那个团体为难民们提供食品供给。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #45444 (CM) & #2442142 (fenfang557)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/45444"}],"organize":[{"c":"I keep meaning to organize my desk.","cn":"我一直想整理書桌。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2374680 (CK) & #13138158 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2374680"}],"original":[{"c":"He compared the copy with the original.","cn":"他比较了复印稿和原件。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #286572 (CK) & #430972 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/286572"},{"c":"He has a lot of original ideas.","cn":"他有很多獨到的見解。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #302085 (CK) & #887677 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/302085"}],"originally":[{"c":"The room originally had no furniture.","cn":"本来这间房间里没有家具。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1795957 (ifethereal) & #1325324 (vicch)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1795957"}],"orphan":[{"c":"He became an orphan when he was ten.","cn":"十岁时他就成了孤儿。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #434852 (lukaszpp) & #4760129 (ryanwoo)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/434852"},{"c":"They adopted the orphan.","cn":"他们收养了那个孤儿。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #305757 (CK) & #8730054 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/305757"}],"other":[{"c":"California and Nevada border on each other.","cn":"加利福尼亞州和內華達州相互接界。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #63511 (CK) & #798247 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/63511"},{"c":"He visited her house the other day.","cn":"他前幾天拜訪了她家。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #273091 (CK) & #885412 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/273091"}],"otherwise":[{"c":"Let's go now. Otherwise, we'll be late.","cn":"咱们现在走吧。要不咱们要迟到了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #407070 (CM) & #407073 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/407070"},{"c":"Go at once, otherwise you will be late.","cn":"立刻走，否則你會遲到。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #52085 (CM) & #919852 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/52085"}],"ought":[{"c":"She ought to have arrived by now.","cn":"她現在應該已經到了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #309964 (CK) & #893995 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/309964"},{"c":"You ought to ask him for advice.","cn":"你应该向他征求意见。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #15832 (CK) & #1768155 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/15832"}],"our":[{"c":"A lot of people need our help.","cn":"一些人需要我們的幫助。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3162203 (CK) & #13266795 (mimosawang)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3162203"},{"c":"After two days our food gave out.","cn":"过两天我们的食物就发完了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #72792 (CM) & #5845593 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/72792"}],"ours":[{"c":"Their apples aren't as tasty as ours.","cn":"他们的苹果没有我们的好吃。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1580112 (fanty) & #4874063 (musclegirlxyp)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1580112"},{"c":"Your team is stronger than ours.","cn":"你們的隊伍比我們的強。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #17665 (CK) & #870063 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/17665"}],"ourselves":[{"c":"We enjoyed ourselves at the party.","cn":"我們在派對上玩得很開心。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #262829 (CK) & #868481 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/262829"},{"c":"We enjoyed ourselves at the picnic.","cn":"我們在野餐玩得很開心。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #262836 (CK) & #868401 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/262836"}],"out":[{"c":"A fire broke out after the earthquake.","cn":"地震之後發生了火災。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #45133 (CK) & #798277 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/45133"},{"c":"A fire broke out during the night.","cn":"在夜間發生了火災。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #323994 (CK) & #798279 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/323994"}],"outline":[{"c":"Line art emphasizes form and outline, over color, shading, and texture.","cn":"線條藝術強調形式和輪廓，而不是顏色、陰影和紋理。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #11119807 (CM) & #13543156 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/11119807"}],"outside":[{"c":"He objected to his wife working outside.","cn":"他反对妻子在外工作。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #296771 (CK) & #2080585 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/296771"},{"c":"Wait for a moment outside the room.","cn":"在房間外面等待片刻。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #319524 (CK) & #797134 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/319524"}],"outskirts":[{"c":"I live on the outskirts of Tokyo.","cn":"我住在東京郊區。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #259667 (CK) & #889312 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/259667"}],"oven":[{"c":"Bread is baked in an oven.","cn":"麵包是在烤箱裡烤的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #34929 (CK) & #13556527 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/34929"},{"c":"Did you remember to turn off the oven?","cn":"你記得關烤箱了嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #11949352 (CK) & #13556528 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/11949352"}],"over":[{"c":"English has spread all over the country.","cn":"英語已經普及全國。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #26253 (CK) & #811860 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/26253"},{"c":"English is studied all over the world.","cn":"世界各地都讀英語。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #26257 (CK) & #797030 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/26257"}],"overcast":[{"c":"It was overcast yesterday.","cn":"昨天是多雲。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #6888946 (CK) & #6092451 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6888946"}],"overcome":[{"c":"She helped him overcome his sadness.","cn":"她幫助他平撫了他的悲傷。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #388342 (CK) & #861317 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/388342"},{"c":"How to overcome the high value of the yen is a big problem.","cn":"如何克服日元升高是个大问题。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #25948 (CK) & #332526 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/25948"}],"overconfident":[{"c":"You should be careful not to become overconfident.","cn":"你要注意不要太自信。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1409581 (CK) & #8936304 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1409581"}],"overestimate":[{"c":"We cannot overestimate the value of health.","cn":"我们不能高估健康的价值。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #238978 (CM) & #791404 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/238978"}],"overhead":[{"c":"I saw a helicopter flying overhead.","cn":"我看见一架直升飞机在头顶飞。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2406061 (CK) & #4845009 (pig8322)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2406061"}],"overlook":[{"c":"These kinds of mistakes are easy to overlook.","cn":"这种错误很容易被人忽视。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2275446 (CK) & #845118 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2275446"},{"c":"This kind of mistake is easy to overlook.","cn":"这种错误很容易被人忽视。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2275445 (CK) & #845118 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2275445"}],"overseas":[{"c":"I'd like to make an overseas call.","cn":"我想打個國際電話。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #241423 (CK) & #893035 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/241423"},{"c":"Do you plan to go overseas?","cn":"你打算出國嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #405494 (CK) & #842437 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/405494"}],"overtime":[{"c":"He was forced to work overtime.","cn":"他被迫加班。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #304009 (CK) & #848213 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/304009"},{"c":"I had to work overtime yesterday.","cn":"我昨天必須加班。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #257775 (CK) & #848217 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/257775"}],"overweight":[{"c":"I'm not the only one who thinks Tom is overweight.","cn":"觉得汤姆肥的人不止我一个。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2537556 (CK) & #8777539 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2537556"},{"c":"Tom was a little overweight when he was a child.","cn":"湯姆在小时候有點超重。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #6882677 (CK) & #6959858 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6882677"}],"overwhelm":[{"c":"I didn't mean to overwhelm you.","cn":"我沒有想要讓你不知所措。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2290418 (CK) & #13138190 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2290418"}],"owe":[{"c":"How much money do I owe you?","cn":"我欠你多少錢？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1103243 (CK) & #1250635 (tsayng)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1103243"},{"c":"I owe my success to his help.","cn":"我的成功要归功于他。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #251286 (CK) & #345962 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/251286"}],"owl":[{"c":"I'm a night owl.","cn":"我是個夜貓子。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #321972 (CK) & #825924 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/321972"}],"own":[{"c":"Can you do that on your own?","cn":"你自己能做到嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #6353418 (CK) & #13598245 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6353418"},{"c":"Did you do this on your own?","cn":"這是你自己做的嗎?","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #16670 (CK) & #775826 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/16670"}],"owner":[{"c":"Are you the owner of this house?","cn":"你是這棟房子的主人嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #70093 (CK) & #865435 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/70093"},{"c":"I'm the owner of this house.","cn":"我是這房子的主人。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #5243413 (CK) & #6064651 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5243413"}],"oxygen":[{"c":"We yawn when we are short of oxygen.","cn":"我们缺氧时就会打哈欠。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #22954 (CK) & #10460425 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/22954"},{"c":"Love is like oxygen.","cn":"爱就像氧气。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1670129 (al_ex_an_der) & #5794118 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1670129"}],"ozone":[{"c":"The ozone in the stratosphere absorbs ultraviolet radiation.","cn":"平流層的臭氧會吸收紫外線。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10540285 (sundown) & #6151835 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/10540285"}]}
